- The ownership and unpaid rules live in the service, which uses constructor injection and no Lombok. The controller stays thin and wraps its result in `ApiResponse.ok`, and the `@RestControllerAdvice` maps domain exceptions to `ApiResponse.error` with no try/catch.
- An invoice that belongs to another customer returns 404, the same as a missing one, so clients can't probe which invoice ids exist. A paid or already-cancelled invoice returns 409.
